# Accepted risks, reviewed on purpose. Everything else fails the pipeline at HIGH/CRITICAL.

# EKS API endpoint is public but restricted to var.admin_cidrs (0.0.0.0/0 is rejected by validation).
AVD-AWS-0040

# Node security group allows egress to 0.0.0.0/0: nodes pull images, Helm charts and Git repos
# through the NAT gateways. Locking this down needs VPC endpoints plus an egress proxy.
AVD-AWS-0104
